SUMMARY:How to Lose a Guy in 10 Days (2003)
LOCATION:The Cinemagic Theater\, 2021 SE Hawthorne Blvd\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5122;-122.6366
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Donald Petrie · 116 min\n\nIt's the battle of wills\, as 
 Andie needs to prove she can dump a guy in 10 days\, whereas Ben needs to 
 prove he can win a girl in 10 days. Now\, the clock is ticking—and the w
 ildly entertaining comedy smash is off and running in this irresistible ta
 le of sex\, lies and outrageous romantic fireworks!\n\nTickets: https://ti
 ckets.thecinemagictheater.com/checkout/showing/how-to-lose-a-guy-in-10-day
 s/4139825/\n\nMore showtimes: https://mattlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-
 pdx/
URL:https://tickets.thecinemagictheater.com/checkout/showing/how-to-lose-a-
 guy-in-10-days/4139825/
